<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF buys 75,000T corn, passes others.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF buys 75,000T corn, passes others.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) said on Thursday it bought 75,000 tonnes of Chinese corn from Louis Dreyfus.</p>
<p>It added it passed on tenders for the remaining 137,500 tonnes of corn and 105,000 tonnes of feed wheat due to high offer prices.  </p>
<p>AN NLCF official said it had originally aimed to buy 160,000 tonnes of corn from China and 52,500 tonnes from Argentina.</p>
<p>Details for the tenders result are as follow:</p>
