<p> One	   12,500   May 17-Jun 5   Jun 10   Kunsan   $141.90</p>
<p> Two	   12,500   May 27-Jun 15  Jun 20   Kunsan   $141.90</p>
<p> Three	 12,500   Jun 16-Jul 5   Jul 10   Kunsan   $142.00</p>
<p> Four	  12,500   Jun 26-Jul 15  Jul 20   Kunsan   $142.00</p>
<p> Five	  12,500   Jul 17-Aug 5   Aug 10   Kunsan   $142.25</p>
<p> Six	   12,500   Jul 27-Jul 15  Aug 20   Kunsan   $142.25</p>
<p> Seven	 12,500   Aug 17-Sep 5   Sep 10   Kunsan    PASSED</p>
<p> Eight	 12,500   Aug 27-Sep 15  Sep 20   Kunsan    PASSED</p>
<p> Nine	  30,000   Aug 17-Sep 5   Sep 10   Inchon    PASSED</p>
<p> Ten	   30,000   Aug 17-Sep 5   Sep 10   Ulsan     PASSED</p>
